      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUNK YARD JEFF (2) finds it hard to break through. Has finished in the placings two on end now, the latest when third (17.62) at this track. Can go on with it. KAKEGURUI (3) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (17.57) at this track behind West On Rose in a Grade 6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Leading chance. ROUND UP (1) comes off an average performance last start when seventh at this track over 400m behind Zatara Storm (23.69) in a Grade 5/6. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. HARPER SMIRCH (7) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to atone.",
